            "popup_title": "Progesterone — the Ovulation Marker",
            "popup_text": "<p>Progesterone rises only after an egg is released, so a mid-cycle blood test for progesterone is how researchers confirm ovulation actually happened. In this trial, the 40:1 group's progesterone rise was significant from the first month.</p>"
