            "popup_text": "<p>Sex Hormone Binding Globulin (SHBG) is a protein that binds hormones — including testosterone — in the blood. Higher SHBG means less free androgen circulating. In this trial, SHBG and estradiol rose significantly with the 40:1 ratio.</p>"
